OL,5,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAustrian-born artist Eva hosts in
OL,7,     Fher cosmopolitan B&B, Roundhouse
OL,8,     FHotel, on Weymouth seafront. Mike
OL,9,     Fand Danny are shocked by the
OL,10,     Fexposed shower.
OL,11,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FShowmen Mike and Danny host at the
OL,13,     Ffour-star Homecliffe Hotel in
OL,14,     FBlackpool. Sylvie and Alan have a
OL,15,     Fgreat view... of the local car
OL,16,     Fwash. And at breakfast, Eva sends
OL,17,     Fher food back twice!
