OL,13,     Fdamaged his ankle after coming off
OL,14,     Fhis bike in the woods. Derek has
OL,15,     Fhad a suspected stroke. Bridget
OL,16,     Fbroke her wrist on a mountain path
OL,17,     Fin Greece.
